from Wiki's entry on Dungeon Keeper 1:

"Bile Demon: A fat, legless but tough creature that utilises his 
flatulence and flails attached to his horns to attack enemy forces. 
These creatures will automatically pick fights with Skeletons. The only 
creature in the game that knows Fart. It is immune to poison gas and 
cannot be blown by the Whirlwind move due to its extreme weight."

useful for blocking passageways.


